1
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,160
No, Long.

2
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:38,890
This doesn't sound like something you would say.

3
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,800
I... That's what I think.

4
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:43,280
Did you take this case to win?

5
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:46,000
When you left Honghu to work on your own,

6
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,039
was it to make money?

7
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:49,759
Wasn't it to help Old Pan

8
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:52,080
and the sick people in Fuyuan Village?

9
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:56,220
Because they were deceived and bullied by Wangang.

10
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,640
No one told them the truth.

11
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,280
No one spoke up for them.

12
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,610
No one stood up for them.

13
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,440
Didn't you step forward to uphold justice?

14
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,800
If you back out now,

15
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:09,090
they will have absolutely no hope.

16
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,000
You're not the type to quit halfway.

17
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,760
I just can't hold on anymore.

18
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,760
It's too hard.

19
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:23,440
I really can't hold on anymore, Dad.

20
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,400
Long...

21
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,320
Do you remember when you were in school?

22
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,640
A few boys in your class

23
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,680
specifically bullied a girl with glasses,

24
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,680
throwing her stationery and her schoolbag.

25
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,560
Then you saw it,

26
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,800
rushed up to fight them,

27
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,880
and scratched the face

28
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:41,200
of one of those boys.

29
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:43,440
And then,

30
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:45,570
they got older students to corner you,

31
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,140
asking if you would give in

32
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,680
and if you still dared to be a busybody.

33
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,490
You didn't give in then.

34
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,880
You didn't back down.

35
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:55,920
You said, 'Draw a sword and help when seeing injustice.

36
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:57,120
My dad taught me that.

37
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,920
Do you think you're right to bully people?'

38
00:02:58,920 --> 00:02:59,920
I just wouldn't give in.

39
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,320
I'll fight you to the end.

40
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,540
Your Brother Jun is now

41
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,320
approaching sixty.

42
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,690
I really don't have anything special to show off.

43
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,480
The only thing I can show off,

44
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,890
the thing that makes me most proud,

45
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:18,800
is that I have a brave and righteous daughter.

46
00:03:44,079 --> 00:03:45,010
Think carefully

47
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:48,960
about what kind of lawyer you really want to be.

48
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,640
Director.

49
00:03:52,079 --> 00:03:52,960
I resign.

50
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:56,480
A lawyer's sword must be wielded for the defenseless.

51
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,240
Lawyer Xiao, I want to appeal.

52
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,520
Why do you say I didn't save my child?

53
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:03,760
The scales must be balanced for the voiceless.

54
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,320
I solemnly swear

55
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,760
to voluntarily dedicate myself to the political and legal cause,

56
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:10,080
be loyal to the people,

57
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,880
uphold humanistic values,

58
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,640
wield the sword of justice,

59
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,280
and hold the scales of righteousness.

60
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,760
I went back to Tieling a couple of days ago

61
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,880
and saw Wu Lian.

62
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,240
She insisted I give this letter to you.

63
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,880
I made a cross-stitch.

64
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,040
It's just a small token of my appreciation.

65
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,400
Aunt Fang embroidered all our names on it.

66
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,400
Thank you, everyone.

67
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,160
Thank you.

68
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,340
So whatever you do,

69
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,000
I will support you without hesitation.

70
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:37,130
Lawyer Xiao, I don't want money and I won't take up space.

71
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,840
Just give me a chance to learn.

72
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:41,680
Xiao Longnv Law Firm Reopens

73
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:45,760
Happy opening.

74
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,320
Start over.

75
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:48,080
Lawyer Xiao.

76
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,320
This client, Xiao Jun,

77
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:53,960
has a favor to ask.

78
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,400
What is it?

79
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,600
Please

80
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,720
keep fighting this lawsuit.

81
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,360
And please

82
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:05,820
protect yourself.

83
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,780
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

84
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,040
Did you notice?

85
00:05:57,360 --> 00:06:00,090
The place upstairs hasn't opened for three days.

86
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:03,060
Is Xiao Longnv's law firm going out of business?

87
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,800
At the very beginning,

88
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,530
I didn't think she'd last long.

89
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:08,080
Making it this far

90
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,640
is already a miracle.

91
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:10,840
Why did she have to

92
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,920
clash with Wangang?

93
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,640
If she hadn't,

94
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,240
wouldn't she be doing pretty well right now?

95
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,400
Yeah, it's a bit of a pity.

96
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,480
She's actually a decent person.

97
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,600
Want to go upstairs and sit for a bit?

98
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,360
No, no, no.

99
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,400
I'll leave you to it.

100
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,440
You go ahead.

101
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,520
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

102
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:30,980
She hasn't been here for three days. Who knew she'd come today?

103
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:37,600
Luo Zhi.

104
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,600
Director.

105
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,730
Why are you here?

106
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:42,520
I thought I'd come and sweep the floor.

107
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,010
Sweeping the floor.

108
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:48,140
The windows are all replaced.

109
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,740
He's done a lot of work.

110
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,280
That's why I say Luo Zhi is reliable.

111
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,440
Unlike Miaomiao.

112
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,400
When she says she's on vacation, she really takes a vacation.

113
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,600
This kid really is...

114
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,120
No.

115
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:06,440
I... I arrived earlier than him.

116
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:06,840
Right, right.

117
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,480
You're really easy to provoke.

118
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,740
One sentence and you gave yourself away.

119
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,400
Sister Long.

120
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,200
We didn't disobey you.

121
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:21,120
We couldn't stay at home for another day.

122
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,040
We just wanted to work.

123
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,640
I missed you and the law firm.

124
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,040
I love working.

125
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,600
I love working too.

126
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:28,200
This is our law firm.

127
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:30,640
We should face difficulties together.

128
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,159
We...

129
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,700
We don't want to be deserters.

130
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,360
You two...

131
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,560
You two came back.

132
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:50,920
Thank you.

133
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,200
What do you mean, Sister?

134
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,330
I've figured it out.

135
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:58,720
The three of us will stand together

136
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,680
and fight the evil forces head-on.

137
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:03,320
Right. We live in a society ruled by law, so we're not afraid of them.

138
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,080
Yes.

139
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:05,840
Let's get to work.

140
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,160
Great.

141
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,130
Fighting against evil forces.

142
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:11,640
Get to work.

143
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,039
Bowen.

144
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,880
We need to reorganize

145
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,919
the organizational structure of Wangang Group.

146
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:41,580
Sort out all the information since the establishment of Wangang.

147
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,800
You know better than I do

148
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,060
what Sun Zhuoli is capable of.

149
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,880
You didn't know about this?

150
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,560
No, I haven't heard of it.

151
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,160
Hey guys, having a drink?

152
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:12,240
Why isn't the injured guy here?

153
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:12,960
Injured?

154
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:14,890
He went back.

155
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,960
Went back?

156
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,960
Went back to his hometown?

157
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,880
Look, I specially prepared this

158
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,160
medicinal liquor for bruises.

159
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,720
It's my family's secret recipe.

160
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,440
If he went back to his hometown, I can mail it to him.

161
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,570
Give me his address.

162
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,320
That's fine.

163
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,040
I'll ask Dali later.

164
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,040
I'll get the address and mail it.

165
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,680
To show

166
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:37,200
my sincerity in making friends with you all,

167
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,600
I'll chug a bottle, okay?

168
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,360
Come on.

169
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,720
One bottle.

170
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,280
I'll chug it.

171
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,880
You guys drink as you please.

172
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,880
It's been years since I chugged.

173
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,440
I made a little mistake.

174
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,880
But you can all see

175
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,540
that I'm an honest man, right?

176
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,400
See? Right.

177
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,000
This is the right vibe.

178
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,400
We brothers

179
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:07,640
should all be lively.

180
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,320
I'm so dirty.

181
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,320
The M&A is settled, and the board seats are being adjusted.

182
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,520
Why am I not included?

183
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:40,000
Board seats affect the company's management structure.

184
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:43,520
We must comprehensively consider personal ability, qualifications,

185
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:45,920
and long-term contributions to the group.

186
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:48,000
You haven't been with the company long enough.

187
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,320
Gain some experience for a few years.

188
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,320
There's no one else here.

189
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,120
You don't have to give me the bureaucratic talk.

190
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,480
Whether I have the qualifications or not,

191
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,120
isn't it just a matter of your word?

192
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,800
Or maybe you just don't want me on the board at all.

193
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:59,260
You're just stringing me along, aren't you?

194
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,760
Unbelievable.

195
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:03,200
Get out.

196
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,960
I said get out!

197
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:08,680
Look at yourself right now.

198
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:11,480
You're impetuous and eager for quick success.

199
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,480
Didn't I tell you

200
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,600
that your status is different now?

201
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,760
Stop acting like you used to,

202
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,400
like some street punk.

203
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,000
I've always been a punk!

204
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,690
Whose fault is that?

205
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,320
Don't you know it yourself?

206
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,280
Now you think I'm an embarrassment, huh?

207
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:30,440
Wan Jiliang, don't think I don't know.

208
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,080
You just can't have kids anymore,

209
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,760
so you came to claim me as a ready-made son.

210
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,160
Is that how you talk to me?

211
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,800
Do you still see me as your father?

212
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,480
Have you ever been a father to me for even a day?

213
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:41,360
When my mom and I were out there

214
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:43,120
and got kicked out, where were you?

215
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,440
Where were you when I was called a bastard?

216
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,170
Where were you when my mom died?

217
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:48,280
I really...

218
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:48,840
Dad.

219
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,560
Fine, you look down on me, right?

220
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,440
I'll fight for this board seat myself

221
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,480
to prove it to you.

222
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,260
What can you fight for without me?

223
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,720
What are you looking at? Move.

224
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,280
What's wrong?

225
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,560
Didn't you hear?

226
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:13,040
I saw Assistant Wan storm out

227
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:14,720
of Director Wan's office.

228
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,280
These two are really something.

229
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:18,800
They should just talk about family matters behind closed doors at home.

230
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:20,320
Why make such a big scene here?

231
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,280
Alright, stop gossiping.

232
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:23,560
There are so many documents. Hurry up and find them.

233
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,080
Sorry I'm late.

234
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:27,360
You call this late?

235
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,040
You're early.

236
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,200
If you were any later, we'd be off work.

237
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,660
Something came up at home.

238
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,080
You're buying coffee later.

239
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:36,720
Okay.

240
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:40,440
Jiliang Yiri.

241
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,200
Geliang.

242
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:42,890
Wan Jiliang.

243
00:12:58,920 --> 00:12:59,980
Thank you, Master.

244
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:04,410
Smells good.

245
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:07,840
You must be exhausted from the recent merger.

246
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:10,220
Do you want to take a vacation?

247
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,860
The farmers' case is about to go to the second trial.

248
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,500
Let's wait until I'm done.

249
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,120
Is this case that difficult?

250
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:18,920
Doesn't it involve

251
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:21,120
an old score from over twenty years ago?

252
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,570
It is indeed a bit of a headache.

253
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:28,840
Master, why don't you give me some pointers?

254
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:32,200
What exactly should I do?

255
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:39,480
You're coming to me for the answers.

256
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,360
These old accounts

257
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:51,280
are like the mold spots on this tea cake.

258
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,530
They are an eyesore,

259
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,500
but if you scrape them off,

260
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,760
you can still brew it.

261
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,940
But this mold spot in Fuyuan Village,

262
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,970
how can it be scraped off so easily?

263
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,480
Not only is it hard to scrape off,

264
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,440
but it also easily seeps deep inside.

265
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,880
In the end, the tea cake is ruined.

266
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:10,520
No matter how you brew it,

267
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:12,320
the tea won't taste good, right?

268
00:14:12,760 --> 00:14:14,420
Actually, the taste of the tea

269
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:16,440
when brewed

270
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:20,760
depends on the person brewing it.

271
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:24,960
Right.

272
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:29,280
It depends on the person brewing it.

273
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:41,090
Sister Long, the date for the second trial is set,

274
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:43,160
but we still lack evidence.

275
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,520
We must get the groundwater samples

276
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:46,320
for testing as soon as possible.

277
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,500
But the villagers are very wary of us now.

278
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:52,010
It'll be hard to get them to cooperate.

279
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:53,960
Let's think of a way

280
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:56,640
to make some noise and distract them.

281
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:58,120
We'll act after dark.

282
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,440
Uncles and aunts,

283
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:03,600
gather at the village entrance for a while.

284
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,640
There's a big show today.

285
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:07,480
I guarantee it'll make you laugh.

286
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,000
Come on.

287
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:08,760
Hurry.

288
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:09,760
Well,

289
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,320
as the saying goes,

290
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,680
I'd rather skip a meal

291
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:13,800
than miss an Errenzhuan show.

292
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:14,360
Yeah.

293
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,240
Folks.

294
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:17,720
We're here for a charity performance today.

295
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:21,400
Every household can get a bag of eggs

296
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,360
on the left.

297
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:26,440
Get your eggs. Get your eggs.

298
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,920
They're right ahead.

299
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:38,560
In the first lunar month...

300
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:39,160
Director.

301
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:41,440
Could there be a well here?

302
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,640
I asked around.

303
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,640
In 1999,

304
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:47,480
the village raised money to dig a well here.

305
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:48,760
Later, when tap water was connected,

306
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,160
this well was abandoned.

307
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,240
Let's split up.

308
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,040
You go that way. I'll go this way.

309
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,000
Luo Zhi.

310
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,400
Come here. Come here. Come here.

311
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,400
Look, look, look.

312
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:12,640
Right?

313
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,900
It really is. But how do we open this lock?

314
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,000
By force.

315
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,120
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

316
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:30,920
The older sister rolls up her sleeves.

317
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,980
And the younger sister shakes it off.

318
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:34,880
It's open. It's open.

319
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:42,960
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

320
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,640
I hear something.

321
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,040
Again, again.

322
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:55,640
One more.

323
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:59,160
Over there. Hurry.

324
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:00,240
Hurry.

325
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,040
Okay.

326
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:04,980
Hurry, hurry, hurry. Someone's coming.

327
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:16,920
What is this?

328
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:19,119
They've run away.

329
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:21,369
Don't let them get away.

330
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:22,560
Go after them.

331
00:17:28,119 --> 00:17:28,650
Let's go.

332
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,880
Got it, got it. Let's go. Hurry.

333
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:33,200
Hurry, hurry.

334
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:35,600
Give me a hand. Hurry, give it to me. Come on.

335
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,320
Stop.

336
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:36,840
They're catching up.

337
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:37,560
Don't run.

338
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,640
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

339
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:39,920
Throw eggs at him.

340
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,080
Hit him.

341
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,400
Hit him.

342
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,360
Get in.

343
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:46,840
Go, go.

344
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,800
Hurry, hurry, hurry. Drive, drive, drive.

345
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:50,530
Close the door. Close the door.

346
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:56,880
A bunch of losers.

347
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,810
You can't even handle such a small matter.

348
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,040
I'm sorry, boss.

349
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,160
I'll go find that female lawyer right now.

350
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:04,920
Forget it.

351
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:13,800
I have a new idea.

352
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:25,720
The mercury content exceeds the national standard by 17 times.

353
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,720
What's the difference between this

354
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,440
and adding arsenic to the water?

355
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:30,400
Let's see what Wangang has to say this time.

356
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,000
But

357
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:32,840
they have a test report now.

358
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:34,280
We have one too,

359
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,560
and the results are completely opposite.

360
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:37,800
If this goes to court,

361
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,760
who will the judge believe?

362
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:41,480
Ours, for sure.

363
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,480
This result is from a provincial institution,

364
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:46,000
much more reliable than the one Wanzhuoli found.

365
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,800
If the judge thinks it's not enough,

366
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:49,000
we'll just find another one.

367
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,080
If not, we'll go to Beijing to look for it.

368
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,480
That's too much trouble.

369
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:54,200
Think about it. Wan Gang is rich and powerful,

370
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:55,280
and ruthless.

371
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:58,000
We can't leave any room for variables.

372
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:01,360
This report at least confirms

373
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:04,420
that their village's groundwater is indeed polluted.

374
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:05,760
So, how do you think

375
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,240
Wan Gang

376
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:09,720
disposed of these pollutants

377
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,680
back then,

378
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:13,200
to allow the pollution to last until now

379
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:15,800
and remain undiscovered for so long?

380
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,280
Burying them.

381
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,300
Exactly. They must have buried them.

382
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:23,560
If we can find and dig up the waste,

383
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,560
wouldn't that be solid evidence?

384
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,280
But Fuyuan Village is so big,

385
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:29,720
and there are so many places to bury things.

386
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:31,880
Where do we dig for the waste?

387
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:33,890
It's been over 20 years,

388
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:35,080
and now

389
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:38,000
the waste can still affect

390
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,200
Mr. Pan's farm.

391
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,050
What does that mean?

392
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:44,240
It means there's a huge amount of it.

393
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:47,080
With such a massive amount of waste buried underground,

394
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,760
they'd rather go to great lengths

395
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:50,280
to supply them with tap water

396
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,520
than dig it out.

397
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:54,440
What does that mean?

398
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,880
It means it's inconvenient to dig.

399
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,480
This is the map of Fuyuan Village.

400
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:01,320
It hasn't changed much over the years.

401
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:02,440
But look here.

402
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:03,920
This highway

403
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:04,760
was only built after 2000.

404
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:06,290
It only existed after 2000.

405
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,920
I got it.

406
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,280
The waste burial site must be very close to the highway.

407
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:11,120
If they dig,

408
00:20:11,120 --> 00:20:13,120
passing cars would be able to see it.

409
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,500
Get ready to go.

410
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:01,090
What's the big occasion today?

411
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,520
Everyone is here.

412
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:07,490
Looking for something, right?

413
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,040
You're late.

414
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:11,800
Too late.

415
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:13,440
It's gone.

416
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:16,040
Search carefully.

417
00:21:28,840 --> 00:21:30,120
What do you mean?

418
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:32,560
Of course, I'm doing my filial duty

419
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:35,240
to solve your problems.

420
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,800
What else?

421
00:21:37,680 --> 00:21:40,760
Doing this will easily alert the enemy.

422
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:45,840
Dad, you're old.

423
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:47,000
If I hadn't

424
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,600
been one step ahead

425
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:49,920
and struck first,

426
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:54,800
they would have found it.

427
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,320
Maybe right now,

428
00:21:56,320 --> 00:21:58,120
you wouldn't be sitting here so peacefully

429
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:59,240
chatting with me.

430
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,120
Well done.

431
00:22:12,280 --> 00:22:13,720
You finally praised me.

432
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:15,320
Then does my

433
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:18,040
performance deserve a reward?

434
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:26,000
I've analyzed it.

435
00:22:26,560 --> 00:22:28,840
Wan Zhuoli dug out the waste.

436
00:22:29,080 --> 00:22:30,480
No matter where it's transported,

437
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:32,320
a transport fleet is needed.

438
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:33,640
Speaking of this,

439
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:35,800
it's my four uncles' line of work.

440
00:22:36,360 --> 00:22:37,960
Please ask around, uncles,

441
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,320
if any fleet has recently

442
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,880
picked up goods from Fuyuan Village

443
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,000
and where they were taken.

444
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:44,520
I'll leave this matter in your hands.

445
00:22:44,600 --> 00:22:45,640
No problem, Xiaolong.

446
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:47,080
Leave it to us.

447
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,400
For Mr. Pan's case,

448
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:50,840
the notice for the second trial has been issued.

449
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:51,920
Before the trial starts,

450
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:54,040
if we don't get solid evidence,

451
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:56,760
I think the outcome will be tough.

452
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,680
What are you all standing around for?

453
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:01,400
Hurry up and get moving.

454
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,040
Let's go.

455
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:02,880
Let's go first.

456
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,920
Thank you, Uncle.

457
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:05,080
It's nothing. Don't worry.

458
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:06,040
Over the past two days, taking advantage of

459
00:23:06,040 --> 00:23:08,440
the opportunity to reorganize the group's organizational structure,

460
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:10,240
I went through the previous project materials again.

461
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:12,120
I checked the project terms, capital flows,

462
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:13,520
and approval records,

463
00:23:13,520 --> 00:23:15,200
and only found a few minor issues.

464
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:16,800
There's really not a single flaw

465
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,600
to be found in Mr. Wan.

466
00:23:18,760 --> 00:23:20,040
Especially when it comes to

467
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,970
tax audits and financial reports.

468
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:23,920
Either he's truly clean,

469
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:26,770
or he has an expert guiding him behind the scenes.

470
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,240
An expert.

471
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:34,840
Perhaps.

472
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:35,800
Boss,

473
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:37,120
what should we do now?

474
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:38,880
Keep investigating.

475
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,410
Change the angle this time.

476
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:41,960
Don't look for what's wrong,

477
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:44,640
but look for why it's so right.

478
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:48,800
Come in.

479
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:50,480
Lawyer Li.

480
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,840
Wangang wants us to provide

481
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:54,360
a recommended list of building material suppliers

482
00:23:54,360 --> 00:23:55,960
for the resort development.

483
00:23:56,040 --> 00:23:57,000
I've finished compiling it.

484
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:58,330
You just need to sign it.

485
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:25,560
Come on.

486
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:26,880
Brothers!

487
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,720
Today, let's congratulate Dali

488
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:30,600
on officially joining the board of directors.

489
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:32,840
Congratulations, Brother Li! Brother Li!

490
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:33,800
Cheers.

491
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:38,120
Let me tell you.

492
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:40,480
I deserve this from God.

493
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:42,850
It was bound to be mine sooner or later.

494
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:44,010
But this isn't over.

495
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,090
What do you mean?

496
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:47,960
I'm going to climb higher on the board of directors in the future.

497
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:49,080
You definitely will.

498
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:50,320
Do you guys support me

499
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,400
or not?

500
00:24:51,560 --> 00:24:52,440
We support you.

501
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:53,240
Dali.

502
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:55,840
Do you know how awesome you are right now?

503
00:24:55,840 --> 00:24:56,400
What?

504
00:24:56,600 --> 00:24:57,640
You are now

505
00:24:57,640 --> 00:25:00,120
a landmark figure in Leyang City,

506
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,320
a tourist attraction. So...

507
00:25:01,320 --> 00:25:01,880
That's too much.

508
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:05,000
Now that you've achieved such greatness,

509
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,960
I think you really don't need

510
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:09,320
to sweat the small stuff.

511
00:25:09,320 --> 00:25:12,040
Like that old man Xiao Jun,

512
00:25:12,080 --> 00:25:13,720
why do you even bother with him?

513
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:14,640
What are you talking about?

514
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:17,920
Why are you still thinking about that family at a time like this?

515
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:20,800
Is there something going on between you

516
00:25:20,800 --> 00:25:21,660
and that woman?

517
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,640
No, I was just thinking.

518
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:26,920
It's better to make friends than enemies.

519
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,160
Be forgiving when possible.

520
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:30,520
Just let them go and be done with it.

521
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:32,360
Stop talking nonsense. Impossible.

522
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:33,080
Let me tell you.

523
00:25:33,080 --> 00:25:35,600
If it weren't for them, I would have joined the board long ago.

524
00:25:35,600 --> 00:25:37,800
I wouldn't have had to wait until today.

525
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:39,040
Right.

526
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,800
I misspoke.

527
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:43,160
I'll punish myself with a drink.

528
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:43,960
Drink up.

529
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:45,290
Let's all drink to that.

530
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:50,090
What does this mean?

531
00:25:50,720 --> 00:25:51,880
Making me drive drunk?

532
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,880
That's a bit too harsh of a punishment.

533
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:56,120
Don't you like Land Rovers?

534
00:25:56,120 --> 00:25:57,880
Your name matches it too.

535
00:25:58,240 --> 00:26:01,080
Full of vigor. What a great meaning.

536
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,960
This car is yours from now on.

537
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:03,600
Just drive it.

538
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:05,880
Dali, this is too expensive.

539
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:06,920
Listen to me.

540
00:26:07,760 --> 00:26:10,560
If I'm enjoying life, would I let you suffer?

541
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:13,160
Brothers united can overcome anything.

542
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:15,200
Let's be at the top together.

543
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:32,440
Lawyer Li, we followed your lead

544
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:33,880
and indeed found some problems.

545
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:34,560
These entities above

546
00:26:34,560 --> 00:26:37,090
that have had multiple dealings with Wangang

547
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:39,660
actually have no real business operations.

548
00:26:39,840 --> 00:26:40,640
It is highly likely

549
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:42,160
that they act as Mr. Wan's 'white gloves'

550
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:43,640
to conduct financial transactions

551
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:45,760
that appear flawless on the surface.

552
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:47,680
I found a few here

553
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:51,200
that were deregistered right after the contracts were fulfilled.

554
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:52,120
Good job.

555
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:53,280
Keep investigating

556
00:26:53,280 --> 00:26:54,520
and see what else you can dig up.

557
00:26:54,520 --> 00:26:55,440
Yes, boss.

558
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:57,760
Come in.

559
00:26:59,560 --> 00:27:00,760
Are you Lawyer Li Xin?

560
00:27:00,960 --> 00:27:02,200
We are from the Justice Bureau.

561
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:03,330
We received a report

562
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:05,720
that in the Wangang Resort development project,

563
00:27:05,720 --> 00:27:07,040
you are suspected of taking kickbacks.

564
00:27:07,040 --> 00:27:08,480
Please cooperate with our investigation.

565
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:09,480
Wait a minute, officer.

566
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,940
Isn't there some mistake?

567
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:12,200
How could Lawyer Li do that?

568
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:14,440
This was signed and confirmed by you.

569
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:16,320
Recommended list of building material suppliers.

570
00:27:16,320 --> 00:27:16,980
Among them,

571
00:27:17,080 --> 00:27:18,760
Hongye Building Materials quoted water glass at

572
00:27:18,760 --> 00:27:19,880
1,500 yuan per ton,

573
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:21,320
while the average market price during the same period

574
00:27:21,320 --> 00:27:22,840
was only 1,000 yuan per ton.

575
00:27:22,840 --> 00:27:24,640
In addition, we seized

576
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:25,960
500,000 yuan in cash from your car.

577
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:27,160
According to the supplier,

578
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:29,090
this is the kickback you demanded.

579
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:31,440
Before the investigation results come out,

580
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:32,760
we need to suspend your license.

581
00:27:32,760 --> 00:27:34,090
There must be a mistake.

582
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:35,240
Lawyer Li, what happened?

583
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,440
Lawyer Li! Lawyer Li!

584
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:09,320
What's going on with you?

585
00:28:09,320 --> 00:28:10,650
Why were you suspended?

586
00:28:11,280 --> 00:28:12,480
You asked me out just to talk about this?

587
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,800
Isn't this a big deal?

588
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:16,640
So what if I'm suspended?

589
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:18,180
Are you satisfied now?

590
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:19,760
Why would I feel relieved?

591
00:28:19,760 --> 00:28:21,600
I'm getting angry just hearing about it.

592
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:22,760
Tell me the truth.

593
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:24,410
Did you offend someone?

594
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:27,440
What if I deserved it?

595
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:29,520
Impossible. I know you too well.

596
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:31,600
Yes, sometimes you are annoying.

597
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,600
But you're only annoying because

598
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:35,760
you're so stubborn about everything.

599
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:37,600
How could someone as stubborn as you

600
00:28:37,600 --> 00:28:39,000
possibly do anything

601
00:28:39,360 --> 00:28:41,560
that violates professional ethics?

602
00:28:42,840 --> 00:28:44,500
Thank you for believing in me.

603
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:46,480
So what exactly happened?

604
00:28:46,680 --> 00:28:47,920
Now I can tell you.

605
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:51,520
Regarding the development of Fuyuan Village,

606
00:28:51,520 --> 00:28:53,120
I did want to save the merger,

607
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,410
but not to protect Wan Jiliang.

608
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:59,000
What I want to protect are the tens of thousands of employees at Wangang.

609
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,260
If Wangang collapses,

610
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,660
they will all lose their jobs.

611
00:29:03,080 --> 00:29:03,680
Of course,

612
00:29:04,280 --> 00:29:06,010
after the merger is completed,

613
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:08,480
whatever responsibilities Wangang should bear,

614
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:10,680
and however much compensation it owes,

615
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:12,320
it won't be able to escape them.

616
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:14,040
As for the pollution in Fuyuan Village,

617
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:15,280
I have been investigating it all along.

618
00:29:15,280 --> 00:29:16,740
What is certain now is that

619
00:29:17,280 --> 00:29:20,610
this is the consequence of Wan Jiliang's personal actions.

620
00:29:21,440 --> 00:29:22,560
So,

621
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:25,480
your original plan was

622
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:30,280
to separate Wangang from Wan Jiliang.

623
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:37,520
But Wan Jiliang knew your purpose in advance

624
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:40,600
and set you up.

625
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:43,010
How could Wan Jiliang know?

626
00:29:43,360 --> 00:29:44,490
It was someone else.

627
00:29:44,960 --> 00:29:45,840
Someone else?

628
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:48,890
Who else could know you so well?

629
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:50,760
Yeah.

630
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:53,500
Who else could know me so well?

631
00:29:58,080 --> 00:29:59,080
Master.

632
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:10,040
Hello.

633
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:12,400
Hello. Are you Li Guochen's family?

634
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:20,360
Doctor, doctor.

635
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:21,480
How is my dad?

636
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:24,000
The patient has glioblastoma.

637
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:26,720
It's a highly malignant brain tumor.

638
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:30,280
From the imaging, it's already in the mid-to-late stage.

639
00:30:30,760 --> 00:30:31,890
Mid-to-late stage?

640
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:34,520
The symptoms of this brain tumor are very obvious.

641
00:30:34,520 --> 00:30:35,760
Persistent headaches,

642
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:36,760
memory loss.

643
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:37,810
Slow reactions.

644
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,880
These don't just appear out of nowhere.

645
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:42,400
If you children had paid a little more attention,

646
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,920
you would have noticed it long ago.

647
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,580
It wouldn't have come to this,

648
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:46,560
bringing him to the hospital only after he fainted.

649
00:30:46,560 --> 00:30:48,440
I saw you hadn't been there for a few days,

650
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:49,640
so I thought I'd come see you.

651
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:50,600
What do you mean a few days?

652
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:51,800
Didn't I just go the day before yesterday?

653
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:52,320
We were even putting things

654
00:30:52,320 --> 00:30:53,880
in the fridge together.

655
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,240
Right, Xiaolong?

656
00:30:56,840 --> 00:30:57,480
Xiaoxin.

657
00:31:01,360 --> 00:31:02,920
Doctor, I'd like to ask,

658
00:31:03,520 --> 00:31:05,560
what is the approximate success rate of this surgery?

659
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:07,360
It's hard to say.

660
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:08,760
Probably

661
00:31:09,760 --> 00:31:10,680
fifty-fifty.

662
00:31:12,840 --> 00:31:13,440
By the way,

663
00:31:13,520 --> 00:31:15,320
you really should go thank

664
00:31:15,320 --> 00:31:17,680
the pedestrian who called the police and an ambulance.

665
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,160
Huanghua Alley in the south of the city,

666
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:20,920
there are so few pedestrians there.

667
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:22,960
The patient fainted there.

668
00:31:23,160 --> 00:31:24,960
If he had been found any later,

669
00:31:25,680 --> 00:31:27,340
it would have been dangerous.

670
00:31:37,360 --> 00:31:38,960
Isn't Huanghua Alley...

671
00:31:39,120 --> 00:31:39,640
You...

672
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,200
Son.

673
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,040
Son.

674
00:32:06,520 --> 00:32:07,160
Son.

675
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:12,920
Son, you...

676
00:32:13,880 --> 00:32:14,560
Wake up.

677
00:32:14,760 --> 00:32:15,680
Wake up, son.

678
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:18,360
Son, wake up.

679
00:32:19,360 --> 00:32:20,000
Son.

680
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:21,040
Son.

681
00:32:23,560 --> 00:32:24,320
Xiaoxin.

682
00:32:25,120 --> 00:32:25,880
Xiaoxin.

683
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,680
My name is Li Guochen.

684
00:33:11,320 --> 00:33:12,980
I am a retired police officer.

685
00:33:13,840 --> 00:33:15,000
I have a brain tumor.

686
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:20,240
The doctor said I will soon forget many things.

687
00:33:20,760 --> 00:33:23,280
So I write down all the important things.

688
00:33:24,800 --> 00:33:26,600
I have a son named Li Xin.

689
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:29,800
He wanted to be a police officer when he was young.

690
00:33:29,800 --> 00:33:32,000
Now he is an excellent lawyer.

691
00:33:33,920 --> 00:33:35,360
To-do list.

692
00:33:36,040 --> 00:33:38,370
Write a piece of calligraphy for Xiaoxin.

693
00:33:40,080 --> 00:33:42,680
Xiaoxin visits me at home once a week.

694
00:33:43,280 --> 00:33:44,480
He likes things clean

695
00:33:44,520 --> 00:33:46,400
and prefers light-tasting food.

696
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:48,600
There's no... no salt in this.

697
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:51,520
I put a little.

698
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:54,760
You're used to eating greasy and salty food,

699
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:56,520
which is bad for your health.

700
00:33:57,280 --> 00:34:00,400
I must remember to remind him to bring less stuff.

701
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:03,120
If you're not going to eat here every time,

702
00:34:03,120 --> 00:34:04,680
don't buy so much stuff.

703
00:34:04,840 --> 00:34:07,170
Look at the fridge. It's completely full.

704
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,530
I can't eat it all by myself.

705
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:12,920
I am divorced from Xiaoxin's mother, Guo Chunling.

706
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:14,850
I'm leaving.

707
00:34:15,040 --> 00:34:18,760
When interacting with her, you must be careful with your boundaries.

708
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:21,159
Don't put Xiaoxin in a difficult position.

709
00:34:22,639 --> 00:34:23,639
Remember that.

710
00:34:27,199 --> 00:34:28,560
Xiaoxin is injured

711
00:34:28,880 --> 00:34:30,719
and needs regular rehabilitation.

712
00:34:30,719 --> 00:34:34,050
On rainy days, you need to remind him to take care of himself.

713
00:34:49,719 --> 00:34:54,239
This was what I wanted to forget most in the past.

714
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:57,920
But now that I'm sick and starting to forget things,

715
00:34:58,280 --> 00:35:01,480
it has become the thing I'm most afraid of forgetting.

716
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:06,120
Because this is what I owe my son the most.

717
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:07,800
That day

718
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:11,180
not only left physical and mental scars on Xiaoxin,

719
00:35:12,080 --> 00:35:14,280
but also ruined his dream of being a cop.

720
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,080
If I forget,

721
00:35:16,840 --> 00:35:19,080
my whole life would be in vain.

722
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:22,440
I must keep it in mind.

723
00:35:23,080 --> 00:35:24,080
In my lifetime,

724
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:27,720
I still owe my son an apology.

725
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:49,720
Nurse, nurse!

726
00:36:49,720 --> 00:36:51,520
Could you tell me which room Li Guochen is in?

727
00:36:51,520 --> 00:36:52,360
Room 208.

728
00:36:52,760 --> 00:36:53,160
Thank you.

729
00:36:53,160 --> 00:36:53,760
Mom.

730
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:55,440
Son.

731
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,160
You got here so fast.

732
00:36:57,160 --> 00:36:58,920
You should have told me so I could pick you up.

733
00:36:58,920 --> 00:37:00,040
No need for that.

734
00:37:00,040 --> 00:37:02,080
Didn't I make it clear on the phone?

735
00:37:03,600 --> 00:37:04,760
How is your dad?

736
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:10,520
How did your dad get such a disease?

737
00:37:10,520 --> 00:37:11,680
As the old saying goes,

738
00:37:11,680 --> 00:37:14,840
people with bad tempers are tough.

739
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:17,520
Your dad will be fine.

740
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:21,800
Well,

741
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:25,200
you get back to work. I'll go see your dad.

742
00:37:25,200 --> 00:37:25,960
Thanks, Mom.

743
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,760
Don't be silly.

744
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:29,920
Mom is here. Don't worry.

745
00:37:30,720 --> 00:37:31,320
That room.

746
00:37:40,040 --> 00:37:42,120
Please take care of things in Xingang

747
00:37:42,600 --> 00:37:43,560
from now on.

748
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,480
Thank you, Director.

749
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:48,880
I will definitely prepare well when I get back.

750
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:49,480
By the way,

751
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,920
about the second trial for that farmer...

752
00:37:52,920 --> 00:37:54,880
I will handle this matter.

753
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:56,000
That's great.

754
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:57,400
With you stepping in, Director,

755
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:59,530
there's nothing that can't be solved.

756
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:00,520
Come in.

757
00:38:02,040 --> 00:38:02,720
Director.

758
00:38:04,080 --> 00:38:05,010
Then, Director,

759
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,500
I won't bother you.

760
00:38:06,720 --> 00:38:07,850
I'll leave you to it.

761
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:12,400
Director,

762
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:15,240
all the information Lawyer Li found

763
00:38:15,240 --> 00:38:16,200
is here.

764
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:22,500
You did a great job.

765
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:25,740
Dali, you wanted to see me?

766
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,530
What's up? Are you two cold?

767
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:33,760
What does this mean? An interrogation?

768
00:38:37,880 --> 00:38:38,340
Come on.

769
00:38:48,080 --> 00:38:49,120
Explain.

770
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:50,730
What's going on?

771
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,520
Boss, don't believe him.

772
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:56,800
We knew something was off about this kid.

773
00:38:56,880 --> 00:38:58,440
You've always been so good to him,

774
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,720
yet he betrayed you.

775
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:13,640
Bowen.

776
00:39:14,040 --> 00:39:16,770
Congratulations on the promotion, Partner Guo.

777
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:35,610
Ungrateful wretch.

778
00:39:42,160 --> 00:39:43,240
Damn traitor.

779
00:39:48,520 --> 00:39:49,280
Got it.

780
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:52,720
You want to know what I recorded, right?

781
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:54,960
Here, let me play it for you.

782
00:39:58,120 --> 00:40:00,960
Dong Beihu is just a dog by the boss's side.

783
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:03,520
He wags his tail and gets a bone.

784
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:05,240
He did absolutely nothing.

785
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:07,240
Yet the boss gave him a luxury car.

786
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:10,320
We work ourselves to death for the boss.

787
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:12,500
Yet we are worse than that dog eunuch.

788
00:40:14,680 --> 00:40:15,680
Want to hear more?

789
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:18,370
Do you still want to listen?

790
00:40:19,320 --> 00:40:21,480
Dali, you can understand it.

791
00:40:22,560 --> 00:40:24,690
You don't need me to translate, right?

792
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:27,460
You handed such a big business over to me.

793
00:40:27,680 --> 00:40:28,880
I want to do a good job.

794
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:30,460
But they don't respect me.

795
00:40:30,680 --> 00:40:32,200
They usually speak in gibberish.

796
00:40:32,200 --> 00:40:33,320
And I don't understand it.

797
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,360
So I figured,

798
00:40:35,080 --> 00:40:36,880
I'd record it and learn it.

799
00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:38,640
So I could communicate with them more.

800
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:39,800
But I didn't expect

801
00:40:40,520 --> 00:40:42,800
them to talk about me like this behind my back.

802
00:40:42,800 --> 00:40:44,460
It's fine if they call me a dog.

803
00:40:45,160 --> 00:40:47,020
It's fine if they call me a eunuch.

804
00:40:48,120 --> 00:40:50,050
But they can't call me a dog eunuch.

805
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:52,880
I know there's a reason they hate me.

806
00:40:53,000 --> 00:40:54,930
It's because you treat me too well.

807
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:57,240
I didn't balance the relationship well.

808
00:40:57,240 --> 00:40:58,400
My EQ is too low.

809
00:40:58,520 --> 00:41:01,000
This is clearly bullying Brother Hu.

810
00:41:01,320 --> 00:41:01,960
Boss.

811
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:02,720
Shut up.

812
00:41:11,360 --> 00:41:13,160
Alright, don't be mad.

813
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,680
Listen up.

814
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:17,480
This is my brother.

815
00:41:17,600 --> 00:41:18,520
Brother.

816
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,560
From now on, anyone who messes with him

817
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:23,360
messes with me. Got it?

818
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:24,880
Got it, boss.

819
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:26,440
Dali, get back to work.

820
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:28,000
I'll go check the kitchen.

821
00:41:32,200 --> 00:41:33,120
Get lost!

822
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:48,320
Not bad.

823
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:50,040
Lawyer Guo is quite good.

824
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:51,520
He is young and promising.

825
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:52,640
I plan to

826
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:54,880
let him take over Department Two

827
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:57,560
and cooperate with Lawyer Shen to continue serving Xingang.

828
00:41:57,560 --> 00:41:59,120
Xingang has just been established.

829
00:41:59,120 --> 00:42:01,600
It indeed needs a lot of fresh blood.

830
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:04,720
Thank you for your guidance, Mr. Wan and Director.

831
00:42:05,240 --> 00:42:05,760
Come.

832
00:42:06,680 --> 00:42:07,680
Work hard.

833
00:42:07,760 --> 00:42:10,200
In a couple of years, he will be a veteran.

834
00:42:17,240 --> 00:42:18,920
Sorry, I need to take a call.

835
00:42:20,840 --> 00:42:21,640
Come, Mr. Wan.

836
00:42:24,160 --> 00:42:25,400
Xiaolong, come here quickly.

837
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:26,960
We found the unloading spot.

838
00:42:26,960 --> 00:42:27,640
Got it figured out?

839
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:28,200
Yes.

840
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:30,200
We split up to find it. Yes.

841
00:42:30,200 --> 00:42:32,280
The basic situation is...

842
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:34,440
Here, here, and here.

843
00:42:34,480 --> 00:42:36,480
Yes, yes, yes. Here, here, and here.

844
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:37,160
I searched the south.

845
00:42:37,160 --> 00:42:39,490
There, there, there. Yes, yes, yes. Here.

846
00:42:39,560 --> 00:42:41,560
There are basically more than 20 of these.

